   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPF:EC0170 Science and Technology Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAJORITY (85 ) OF THE RESOURCES ARE FOR CONTRACTING INDIVIDUAL CONSULTING SERVICES. CONSULTANTS MUST BE FLUENT IN SPANISH AND HAVE EXPERIENCE IN SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY IN THE AREAS OF APPLIED SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH, ECONOMIC EVALUATION, INSTITUTIONALFINANCIAL ANALYSIS AND TRAINING. THE PURCHASE OF SOME EQUIPMENT IS EXPECTED, MOSTLY PCS, WHICH ARE NEEDED TO PREPARE, EVALUATE, MONITOR AND ADMINISTER THE NATIONAL SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY.</narrative>
